{"page":478,"width":1732,"height":2606,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"12.2 입출력 하드웨어","words":[{"text":"12.2","x":1153,"y":154,"width":69,"height":22},{"text":"입출력","x":1239,"y":153,"width":67,"height":26},{"text":"하드웨어","x":1316,"y":153,"width":91,"height":26}]},{"text":"539","words":[{"text":"539","x":1480,"y":152,"width":57,"height":28}]},{"text":"을 A卜\u0026한다. 이 메모리 영역에 데이터를 기록하면 컨트롤러가 자동으로 그것을 스크린","words":[{"text":"을","x":304,"y":280,"width":33,"height":36},{"text":"A卜\u0026한다.","x":351,"y":281,"width":134,"height":37},{"text":"이","x":503,"y":281,"width":26,"height":36},{"text":"메모리","x":546,"y":281,"width":87,"height":37},{"text":"영역에","x":652,"y":281,"width":85,"height":37},{"text":"데이터를","x":753,"y":282,"width":117,"height":37},{"text":"기록하면","x":885,"y":282,"width":119,"height":37},{"text":"컨트롤러가","x":1021,"y":280,"width":155,"height":37},{"text":"자동으로","x":1189,"y":280,"width":127,"height":37},{"text":"그것을","x":1330,"y":281,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"스크린","x":1441,"y":284,"width":96,"height":35}]},{"text":"에 출력하고, 이 메모리를 기반으로 하여 스크린 이미지를 형성한다. 이 방식을 단순해서","words":[{"text":"에","x":306,"y":341,"width":29,"height":35},{"text":"출력하고,","x":349,"y":341,"width":136,"height":37},{"text":"이","x":500,"y":341,"width":25,"height":36},{"text":"메모리를","x":542,"y":341,"width":120,"height":36},{"text":"기반으로","x":674,"y":342,"width":117,"height":36},{"text":"하여","x":803,"y":343,"width":55,"height":36},{"text":"스크린","x":873,"y":342,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"이미지를","x":976,"y":341,"width":122,"height":37},{"text":"형성한다.","x":1110,"y":341,"width":133,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":1258,"y":341,"width":27,"height":37},{"text":"방식을","x":1301,"y":341,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"단순해서","x":1409,"y":341,"width":126,"height":38}]},{"text":"久卜%하기에 좋다. 더구나 메모리에 수백만 바이트를 기록하는 것은 수백만 번 입출력 명","words":[{"text":"久卜%하기에","x":305,"y":400,"width":159,"height":37},{"text":"좋다.","x":479,"y":401,"width":69,"height":36},{"text":"더구나","x":564,"y":401,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"메모리에","x":666,"y":401,"width":116,"height":37},{"text":"수백만","x":796,"y":402,"width":90,"height":37},{"text":"바이트를","x":898,"y":402,"width":121,"height":36},{"text":"기록하는","x":1033,"y":401,"width":123,"height":37},{"text":"것은","x":1169,"y":401,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"수백만","x":1243,"y":402,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"번","x":1354,"y":402,"width":28,"height":35},{"text":"입출력","x":1399,"y":401,"width":90,"height":37},{"text":"명","x":1508,"y":403,"width":27,"height":36}]},{"text":"령어를 이용하는 것보다 빠르다. 따라서 시간이 지남에 따라 시스템은 메모리 맵드 I/O","words":[{"text":"령어를","x":308,"y":460,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"이용하는","x":418,"y":461,"width":125,"height":36},{"text":"것보다","x":557,"y":461,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"빠르다.","x":659,"y":461,"width":95,"height":37},{"text":"따라서","x":768,"y":462,"width":85,"height":37},{"text":"시간이","x":870,"y":462,"width":86,"height":37},{"text":"지남에","x":973,"y":462,"width":87,"height":37},{"text":"따라","x":1076,"y":462,"width":62,"height":36},{"text":"시스템은","x":1150,"y":462,"width":127,"height":36},{"text":"메모리","x":1290,"y":462,"width":91,"height":37},{"text":"맵드","x":1398,"y":462,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"I/O","x":1474,"y":465,"width":65,"height":33}]},{"text":"로 바뀌어 왔다. 오늘날 대부분의 I/0는 메모리 맵드 I/0를 A卜\u0026하여 장치 컨트롤러가","words":[{"text":"로","x":307,"y":524,"width":31,"height":27},{"text":"바뀌어","x":352,"y":521,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"왔다.","x":460,"y":520,"width":70,"height":37},{"text":"오늘날","x":545,"y":521,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"대부분의","x":650,"y":522,"width":115,"height":36},{"text":"I/0는","x":779,"y":525,"width":90,"height":34},{"text":"메모리","x":881,"y":523,"width":86,"height":37},{"text":"맵드","x":984,"y":523,"width":60,"height":36},{"text":"I/0를","x":1056,"y":524,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"A卜\u0026하여","x":1160,"y":523,"width":123,"height":37},{"text":"장치","x":1300,"y":523,"width":60,"height":37},{"text":"컨트롤러가","x":1378,"y":522,"width":162,"height":37}]},{"text":"수행한다.","words":[{"text":"수행한다.","x":306,"y":581,"width":137,"height":36}]},{"text":"입출력 장치 컨트롤러는 보통 네 개의 레지스터로 구성되어 있는데 상4(status), 제","words":[{"text":"입출력","x":370,"y":641,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"장치","x":476,"y":641,"width":59,"height":37},{"text":"컨트롤러는","x":552,"y":642,"width":152,"height":36},{"text":"보통","x":715,"y":644,"width":60,"height":35},{"text":"네","x":786,"y":643,"width":26,"height":37},{"text":"개의","x":827,"y":643,"width":55,"height":37},{"text":"레지스터로","x":898,"y":644,"width":150,"height":36},{"text":"구성되어","x":1059,"y":644,"width":119,"height":36},{"text":"있는데","x":1196,"y":645,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"상4(status),","x":1299,"y":645,"width":194,"height":38},{"text":"제","x":1507,"y":644,"width":29,"height":37}]},{"text":"어(control), 입력(data-in), 출력(data-out) 레지스터들이다.","words":[{"text":"어(control),","x":308,"y":702,"width":180,"height":38},{"text":"입력(data-in),","x":503,"y":701,"width":203,"height":40},{"text":"출력(data-out)","x":718,"y":704,"width":211,"height":39},{"text":"레지스터들이다.","x":944,"y":704,"width":218,"height":37}]},{"text":"입력 레지스터는 호스트가 입력을 얻기 위해 읽기를 수행한다.","words":[{"text":"입력","x":370,"y":791,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"레지스터는","x":446,"y":791,"width":157,"height":36},{"text":"호스트가","x":614,"y":793,"width":122,"height":36},{"text":"입력을","x":749,"y":793,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"얻기","x":850,"y":794,"width":54,"height":36},{"text":"위해","x":920,"y":794,"width":56,"height":36},{"text":"읽기를","x":992,"y":795,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"수행한다.","x":1091,"y":795,"width":130,"height":36}]},{"text":"• 출력 레지스터는 호스트가 데이터를 출력하기 위해 쓰기를 수행한다.","words":[{"text":"•","x":328,"y":871,"width":14,"height":14},{"text":"출력","x":367,"y":861,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"레지스터는","x":446,"y":861,"width":157,"height":36},{"text":"호스트가","x":614,"y":863,"width":123,"height":36},{"text":"데이터를","x":749,"y":864,"width":119,"height":35},{"text":"출력하기","x":878,"y":864,"width":117,"height":36},{"text":"위해","x":1011,"y":865,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"쓰기를","x":1082,"y":864,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"수행한다.","x":1184,"y":865,"width":132,"height":35}]},{"text":"• 상태 레지스터는 호스트가 읽는 용도이며, 이 비트들은 현재의 명령이 완료되었는","words":[{"text":"•","x":328,"y":940,"width":14,"height":14},{"text":"상태","x":366,"y":930,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"레지스터는","x":450,"y":931,"width":157,"height":36},{"text":"호스트가","x":622,"y":933,"width":124,"height":36},{"text":"읽는","x":761,"y":934,"width":59,"height":34},{"text":"용도이며,","x":834,"y":933,"width":129,"height":37},{"text":"이","x":980,"y":934,"width":25,"height":34},{"text":"비트들은","x":1025,"y":934,"width":120,"height":34},{"text":"현재의","x":1160,"y":934,"width":89,"height":35},{"text":"명령이","x":1269,"y":934,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"완료되었는","x":1377,"y":934,"width":164,"height":34}]},{"text":"지, 입력 레지스터로부터 한 바이트를 읽어도 되는지, 그리고 오류가 있었는가와 같","words":[{"text":"지,","x":368,"y":991,"width":39,"height":36},{"text":"입력","x":425,"y":992,"width":58,"height":34},{"text":"레지스터로부터","x":502,"y":992,"width":212,"height":36},{"text":"한","x":730,"y":993,"width":32,"height":34},{"text":"바이트를","x":774,"y":993,"width":121,"height":36},{"text":"읽어도","x":909,"y":993,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"되는지,","x":1011,"y":992,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"그리고","x":1122,"y":993,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"오류가","x":1226,"y":994,"width":96,"height":35},{"text":"있었는가와","x":1336,"y":993,"width":161,"height":35},{"text":"같","x":1509,"y":993,"width":33,"height":34}]},{"text":"은 상태들을 보고한다.","words":[{"text":"은","x":366,"y":1051,"width":34,"height":33},{"text":"상태들을","x":411,"y":1051,"width":129,"height":36},{"text":"보고한다.","x":550,"y":1052,"width":132,"height":36}]},{"text":"• 제어 레지스터는 흐人드가 주변 장치에 입출력 명령을 내리거나 장치의 모드를 변","words":[{"text":"•","x":327,"y":1128,"width":15,"height":15},{"text":"제어","x":367,"y":1119,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"레지스터는","x":448,"y":1120,"width":159,"height":36},{"text":"흐人드가","x":624,"y":1122,"width":120,"height":35},{"text":"주변","x":757,"y":1122,"width":61,"height":35},{"text":"장치에","x":833,"y":1